    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh wow okay thanks for letting me know. i didnt realize it was that serious. my friend was taking it and said it helped her a lot with her mood and she didnt have any issues with her birth control. are you sure though? like is there any way to take them so they dont mess with each other? maybe just a lower dose or something?",
