      "content": "Your friend's experience is anecdotal, and it's not a guarantee of safety for everyone. The interaction between St. John's Wort and hormonal contraceptives is well-documented and serious, so you should not risk it. Even lower doses do not negate the risk of the drug affecting how your pill works in your body. Please consult a healthcare professional to discuss safe, natural options that won't interfere with your current treatment.",
      "source": "target",
